{"4847080": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Mirror of Destiny", "steam_appid": 4847080, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore a Post-Apocalyptic World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a wasteland left behind after the collapse of civilization. Journey through vine-covered ruins, dust-choked settlements, and neon-lit steel cities. The remnants of the old world still grind on, while a new order has already divided people into very different fates. Through each expedition, uncover fragments of the truth behind the catastrophe and rewrite the future of this world before fate begins to turn once more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4847080/extras/7c08bf8a7af7a6c0753b02f9adc6595e.poster.avif?t=1781879368\" width=1170 height=418 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4847080/extras/7c08bf8a7af7a6c0753b02f9adc6595e.webm?t=1781879368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4847080/extras/7c08bf8a7af7a6c0753b02f9adc6595e.mp4?t=1781879368\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Assemble Your Adventuring Party</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along the way, you can choose to travel with companions of different personalities, each carrying secrets of their own. Some are used to walking alone. Some are calm, sharp, and calculating. Some trust only the profit in front of them, while others bear a past no one else knows. They may not trust each other at first, but through support, conflict, and battle, their relationships will gradually change, becoming one of your greatest strengths in the wasteland.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4847080/extras/6073aaea79138dbe31a1a68ee730ca5f.poster.avif?t=1781879368\" width=1170 height=418 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4847080/extras/6073aaea79138dbe31a1a68ee730ca5f.webm?t=1781879368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4847080/extras/6073aaea79138dbe31a1a68ee730ca5f.mp4?t=1781879368\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Turn-Based Tactical Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat unfolds turn by turn. Positioning, turn order, and battlefield conditions all shape how each party member can act. Character growth is not locked to a fixed path. Skills from different systems can be mixed and matched to create your own combat style: telekinesis, elements, firearms, melee combat, assassination, and more can all be rebuilt around the same character. Different elements can also interact on the battlefield, triggering unexpected chain reactions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4847080/extras/13d014e0c632c98eff27fc38aa066bf8.poster.avif?t=1781879368\" width=1170 height=418 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4847080/extras/13d014e0c632c98eff27fc38aa066bf8.webm?t=1781879368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4847080/extras/13d014e0c632c98eff27fc38aa066bf8.mp4?t=1781879368\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Problems Have More Than One Solution</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On your journey, many problems can be solved in more than one way. You can negotiate face to face, sneak around through another route, or, of course, settle things with your fists. But be careful: every choice you make may push events in a different direction, and every step you take will shape this adventure into a story that belongs only to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4847080/extras/8402e4e115e609e449532f493907f480.poster.avif?t=1781879368\" width=1170 height=418 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4847080/extras/8402e4e115e609e449532f493907f480.webm?t=1781879368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4847080/extras/8402e4e115e609e449532f493907f480.mp4?t=1781879368\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore a Post-Apocalyptic World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a wasteland left behind after the collapse of civilization. Journey through vine-covered ruins, dust-choked settlements, and neon-lit steel cities. The remnants of the old world still grind on, while a new order has already divided people into very different fates. Through each expedition, uncover fragments of the truth behind the catastrophe and rewrite the future of this world before fate begins to turn once more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4847080/extras/7c08bf8a7af7a6c0753b02f9adc6595e.poster.avif?t=1781879368\" width=1170 height=418 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4847080/extras/7c08bf8a7af7a6c0753b02f9adc6595e.webm?t=1781879368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4847080/extras/7c08bf8a7af7a6c0753b02f9adc6595e.mp4?t=1781879368\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Assemble Your Adventuring Party</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along the way, you can choose to travel with companions of different personalities, each carrying secrets of their own. Some are used to walking alone. Some are calm, sharp, and calculating. Some trust only the profit in front of them, while others bear a past no one else knows. They may not trust each other at first, but through support, conflict, and battle, their relationships will gradually change, becoming one of your greatest strengths in the wasteland.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4847080/extras/6073aaea79138dbe31a1a68ee730ca5f.poster.avif?t=1781879368\" width=1170 height=418 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4847080/extras/6073aaea79138dbe31a1a68ee730ca5f.webm?t=1781879368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4847080/extras/6073aaea79138dbe31a1a68ee730ca5f.mp4?t=1781879368\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Turn-Based Tactical Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat unfolds turn by turn. Positioning, turn order, and battlefield conditions all shape how each party member can act. Character growth is not locked to a fixed path. Skills from different systems can be mixed and matched to create your own combat style: telekinesis, elements, firearms, melee combat, assassination, and more can all be rebuilt around the same character. Different elements can also interact on the battlefield, triggering unexpected chain reactions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4847080/extras/13d014e0c632c98eff27fc38aa066bf8.poster.avif?t=1781879368\" width=1170 height=418 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4847080/extras/13d014e0c632c98eff27fc38aa066bf8.webm?t=1781879368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4847080/extras/13d014e0c632c98eff27fc38aa066bf8.mp4?t=1781879368\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Problems Have More Than One Solution</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On your journey, many problems can be solved in more than one way. You can negotiate face to face, sneak around through another route, or, of course, settle things with your fists. But be careful: every choice you make may push events in a different direction, and every step you take will shape this adventure into a story that belongs only to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4847080/extras/8402e4e115e609e449532f493907f480.poster.avif?t=1781879368\" width=1170 height=418 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4847080/extras/8402e4e115e609e449532f493907f480.webm?t=1781879368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4847080/extras/8402e4e115e609e449532f493907f480.mp4?t=1781879368\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Mirror of Destiny is a post-apocalyptic RPG. Build a party of companions with hidden secrets, face unknown threats through choice-driven quests and turn-based tactical combat, and shape the fate of a broken world ruled by corporations, wasteland factions, and superpowered beings.", "supported_languages": "English, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/ap